    N inverting = 71;  median a_0 of the inverting subset = 1.102e-10 m/s^2   (bootstrap +-0.123 dex)
    CENSORED whole-sample median (the 24 non-inverting galaxies placed below all others, = the 33.1th percentile of the inverting subset): 5.115e-11 m/s^2 = canonical -0.262 / alt -0.344 dex
       vs canonical 9.36e-11 : +0.071 dex
